{"records":[{"participants":["ACC-B1"],"source_refs":[{"source_id":"b-platform-001","source_locator":"case-b-scale/platform/field-availability"}],"summary":"The platform response states that the supplied account export contains no public owner field for ACC-B1. It provides no substitute identity and neither confirms nor denies any person as the controller, leaving ownership and control unresolved.","timestamp_text":null},{"participants":["Bob Niran","ACC-B1"],"source_refs":[{"source_id":"b-duplicate-001","source_locator":"case-b-scale/memo/addendum-1"}],"summary":"A memo addendum repeats that the owner is unknown and mentions Bob Niran, but expressly says he is not established as the controller. The addendum is characterized as part of the same investigation memo rather than independent confirmation or a new ownership finding.","timestamp_text":null},{"participants":[],"source_refs":[{"source_id":"b-admin-001","source_locator":"case-b-scale/administration/packet-index"}],"summary":"The case index records the presence of the memo, interview, registry excerpt, evidence request, device inventory, and provider correspondence, but does not validate their claims or resolve the missing ownership and audit information.","timestamp_text":null}]}